          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="Courier New" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">scanf()</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> 用于输入数据，</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="Courier New" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">printf()</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> 用于输出数据。</span><br/><span color="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">注意：输入变量前要加 </span><strong><span color="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="Courier New" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">&amp;</span></strong><span color="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> 取地址符</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">。</span></p>
